,"periods":["warsaw"],"sortOrder":135},{"id":"M227","title":"Bronisław Kaper’s University of Warsaw student record book — opening folios, 1920","mediaType":"image","storageType":"local","period":"warsaw","description":"Opening folios of Bronisław Kaper’s student record book (“Wykaz wykładów i ćwiczeń”) at the University of Warsaw, Faculty of Law and Political Sciences. The spread includes his student portrait and matriculation information. University of Warsaw Archives, Bronisław Kaper student file, RP 6854, fols. 38–39.","assetPath":"assets/images/timeline/kaper-student-record-book-university-of-warsaw.jpg","assetPaths":["assets/images/timeline/kaper-student-record-book-university-of-warsaw.jpg"],"assetCount":1,"altText":"Open student record book with a portrait of young Bronisław Kaper and University of Warsaw matriculation details.","rightsStatus":"ok","rightsNote":"Reproduced by permission of the University of Warsaw Archives.","sortOrder":227,"slug":"bronislaw-kaper-student-record-book-university-of-warsaw","publicCaption":"Opening folios of Bronisław Kaper’s University of Warsaw student record book (“Wykaz wykładów i ćwiczeń”), 1920.","publicCreditLine":"Archiwum Uniwersytetu Warszawskiego, Bronisław Kaper student file, RP 6854, fols. 38–39. Reproduced by permission.","galleryStatus":"eligible","organizationIds":["ORG057"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110"],"timelineEventIds":["TE0004"],"heroTimelineEventIds":["TE0004"],"category":"archival document","periods":["warsaw"]}],"works":[],"films":[],"songs":[],"otherWorks":[],"titleVariants":[],"workRelations":[],"timelineEvents":[{"id":"TE0001","slug":"23-january-5-february-1902-birth","title":"Birth","label":"5 Feb 1902 · Birth in Warsaw","displayDate":"23 January / 5 February 1902","dateStart":"1902-02-05","datePrecision":"day","sortDate":"1902-02-05","sortOrder":1,"displayMode":"point","eventType":"life","period":"warsaw","periodKey":"warsaw","category":"birth_family","filterTags":["life","warsaw"],"placeDisplay":"Warsaw","cityKey":"warsaw","shortDescription":"Born in Warsaw to Szmul Moszek Kaper and Maria Mucha, in a Jewish family registered in the city’s non-Christian civil records.","longDescription":"Born on January 23 (February 5, New Style) in Warsaw. Father – Szmul Moszek (later Stanisław/Samuel) Kaper, bookkeeper, aged 28. Mother – Maria (Mariam) née Mucha, aged 24. The family is of Jewish faith (registered at the Office of Civil Status for Non-Christian Confessions, 8th Jerusalem District, Warsaw).","featured":true,"roles":["biographical_event"],"personIds":["P009"],"sourceIds":["SRC0012","SRC0110"],"mediaIds":["M030","M087"],"heroMediaIds":["M087"],"placeIds":["PL001","PL014"],"periods":["warsaw"]},{"id":"TE0004","slug":"formal-matriculation-university-of-warsaw","title":"Formal matriculation at the University of Warsaw","label":"6 Feb 1920 · Formal UW matriculation","displayDate":"6 February 1920","dateStart":"1920-02-06","datePrecision":"day","sortDate":"1920-02-06","sortOrder":4.6,"displayMode":"point","eventType":"life","period":"warsaw","periodKey":"warsaw","category":"law_studies","filterTags":["life","warsaw"],"placeDisplay":"Warsaw","cityKey":"warsaw","shortDescription":"After the one-semester delay documented separately, Kaper was formally entered in the Faculty of Law album at the University of Warsaw.","longDescription":"This event now records the formal matriculation rather than the earlier October 1919 application. Kaper was entered in the Faculty of Law and Political Sciences album on 6 February 1920, under album number 6854.","roles":["education_event","source_document"],"personIds":["P009"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110","SRC0490"],"mediaIds":["M030","M094","M227"],"heroMediaIds":["M227"],"placeIds":["PL001","PL008"],"periods":["warsaw"]},{"id":"TE0005","slug":"17-july-1920-baptism","title":"Baptism","label":"17 July 1920 · Baptism","displayDate":"17 July 1920","dateStart":"1920-07-17","datePrecision":"day","sortDate":"1920-07-17","sortOrder":5,"displayMode":"point","eventType":"life","period":"warsaw","periodKey":"warsaw","category":"religion_identity","filterTags":["life","warsaw"],"placeDisplay":"Warsaw","cityKey":"warsaw","shortDescription":"Kaper is baptized at St. Alexander’s parish in Warsaw, marking his conversion to Catholicism.","longDescription":"On July 17, Kaper is baptized at the Roman Catholic Parish of St. Alexander in Warsaw, at the age of 18. The baptism marks his conversion from Judaism to Catholicism.","featured":true,"roles":["biographical_event","identity_document"],"personIds":["P009"],"sourceIds":["SRC0012","SRC0110"],"mediaIds":["M030","M065"],"heroMediaIds":["M065"],"placeIds":["PL001","PL011"],"periods":["warsaw"]},{"id":"TE0011","slug":"1924-application-to-faculty-of-philosophy","title":"Application to Faculty of Philosophy","label":"1924 · Faculty of Philosophy application","displayDate":"1924","dateStart":"1924-01-01","datePrecision":"year","sortDate":"1924-07-01","sortOrder":11,"displayMode":"point","eventType":"life","period":"warsaw","periodKey":"warsaw","category":"education","filterTags":["life","warsaw"],"placeDisplay":"Warsaw","cityKey":"warsaw","shortDescription":"Kaper seeks to transfer from law to the humanities, while taking academic leave.","longDescription":"In September, applies for transfer to the Faculty of Philosophy, Humanities Section. The immatriculation committee conditionally accepts him, pending a certificate of departure from the Faculty of Law. Takes academic leave for the winter and summer semesters of 1923/24.","roles":["education_event"],"personIds":["P003","P009"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110","SRC0490"],"placeIds":["PL001","PL008"],"periods":["warsaw"]},{"id":"TE0012","slug":"14-february26-may-1925-official-completion-of-law-studies","title":"Official completion of law studies","label":"Feb–May 1925 · Law studies completed","displayDate":"14 February–26 May 1925","dateStart":"1925-02-14","dateEnd":"1925-05-26","datePrecision":"multi_date","sortDate":"1925-03-14","sortOrder":12,"displayMode":"cluster","eventType":"life","period":"warsaw","periodKey":"warsaw","category":"law_studies","filterTags":["life","warsaw"],"placeDisplay":"Warsaw","cityKey":"warsaw","shortDescription":"Kaper completes his law studies, passing the final exam and receiving formal university documents.","longDescription":"On February 14, passes the judicial exam (egzamin prawno-sądowy) — the final of three required examinations — with a grade of \"satisfactory\" (dostateczny). On March 14, the Faculty of Law issues diploma no. 124. On May 26, receives his Certificate of Departure (Świadectwo Wystąpienia) no. 944.","roles":["education_event"],"personIds":["P009"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110","SRC0490"],"mediaIds":["M030","M093"],"heroMediaIds":["M093"],"placeIds":["PL001","PL008"],"periods":["warsaw"]},{"id":"TE0044","slug":"university-admission-delayed-disciplinary-sanction","title":"University admission delayed by a disciplinary sanction","label":"Delayed UW matriculation","displayDate":"18 October 1919 / 6 February 1920","dateStart":"1919-10-18","dateEnd":"1920-02-06","datePrecision":"multi_date","sortDate":"1919-10-18","sortOrder":4.5,"displayMode":"point","eventType":"life","period":"warsaw","periodKey":"warsaw","category":"education","filterTags":["life","warsaw"],"placeDisplay":"Warsaw","cityKey":"warsaw","shortDescription":"Kaper’s admission to the Faculty of Law at the University of Warsaw was delayed by a one-semester disciplinary sanction before his formal matriculation in February 1920.","longDescription":"University records show that Kaper applied to the Faculty of Law at the University of Warsaw in October 1919, but that the Matriculation Commission rejected his immediate admission after a disciplinary incident. The sanction was temporary: he later described it in his curriculum vitae as a one-semester relegation, and he was formally entered in the faculty album on 6 February 1920.","roles":["education_event","source_document"],"personIds":["P009"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110","SRC0490"],"mediaIds":["M030","M094"],"heroMediaIds":["M094"],"placeIds":["PL001","PL008"],"periods":["warsaw"]},{"id":"TE0045","slug":"police-certificate-mosaic-religion","title":"Police certificate records Mosaic religion","label":"Mosaic religion recorded","displayDate":"21 April 1920","dateStart":"1920-04-21","datePrecision":"day","sortDate":"1920-04-21","sortOrder":4.8,"displayMode":"point","eventType":"life","period":"warsaw","periodKey":"warsaw","category":"religion_identity","filterTags":["life","warsaw"],"placeDisplay":"Warsaw","cityKey":"warsaw","shortDescription":"A police certificate issued shortly before Kaper’s baptism recorded his religion as “Mosaic,” the official term then used for the Jewish faith.","longDescription":"The certificate of good conduct issued by the Warsaw State Police forms an important documentary link between Kaper’s university records and the later baptismal entry. It anchors the discussion of identity in administrative sources rather than retrospectively imposed narratives: Kaper appears in the record as a young Warsaw student from an assimilated Jewish family whose formal confessional status changed only a few months later.","roles":["identity_document","source_document"],"personIds":["P009"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110","SRC0490"],"mediaIds":["M030"],"placeIds":["PL001","PL007"],"periods":["warsaw"]}],"places":[{"id":"PL007","displayName":"Wilcza 29, Warsaw","authorizedName":"Wilcza 29, Warsaw","placeType":"address","city":"Warsaw","region":"Masovian Voivodeship","country":"Poland","latitude":52.2263,"longitude":21.0178,"period":"warsaw","slug":"wilcza-29-warsaw","publicNote":"Warsaw address associated with Kaper in university/police documentation.","mapPrecision":"address_level","publicScope":"map_and_detail","timelineEventIds":["TE0045"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110","SRC0490"],"periods":["warsaw"]},{"id":"PL008","displayName":"University of Warsaw","authorizedName":"University of Warsaw / Uniwersytet Warszawski","placeType":"institution","city":"Warsaw","region":"Masovian Voivodeship","country":"Poland","latitude":52.2394,"longitude":21.0184,"period":"warsaw","slug":"university-of-warsaw","publicNote":"University of Warsaw campus associated with Kaper's law studies. The marker identifies the historic central university site at campus level; it does not claim a particular Faculty of Law room or classroom.","mapPrecision":"site_approximate","publicScope":"map_and_detail","timelineEventIds":["TE0004","TE0011","TE0012","TE0044"],"sourceIds":["SRC0110","SRC0490"],"periods":["warsaw"],"mediaIds":["M093","M094","M136"]},{"id":"PL011","displayName":"St. Alexander’s Church, Warsaw","authorizedName":"Kościół św. Aleksandra w Warszawie","placeType":"venue","city":"Warsaw","region":"Masovian Voivodeship","country":"Poland","latitude":52.2273,"longitude":21.0227,"period":"warsaw","slug":"st-alexanders-church-warsaw","publicNote":"Church connected with Kaper’s 1920 baptism record.","mapPrecision":"venue_level","publicScope":"map_and_detail","timelineEventIds":["TE0005"],"sourceIds":["SRC0012","SRC0110"],"periods":["warsaw"],"mediaIds":["M065","M213"]},{"id":"PL014","displayName":"Sienna 44, Warsaw","authorizedName":"Sienna 44, Warsaw / Warszawa, ul. Sienna 44","placeType":"address","city":"Warsaw","region":"Masovian Voivodeship","country":"Poland","latitude":52.2322,"longitude":21.0021,"period":"warsaw","slug":"sienna-44-warsaw","publicNote":"Warsaw birthplace context associated with Sienna 44. The coordinates indicate the address area; exact continuity between the 1902 property and the modern address point remains unverified.","mapPrecision":"address_level","publicScope":"map_and_detail","timelineEventIds":["TE0001"],"mediaIds":["M087"],"sourceIds":["SRC0012","SRC0110","SRC0353","SRC0490","SRC0524"],"periods":["warsaw"]}],"contributions":[],"personNameVariants":[]}}
